{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4eMCZRN16MD1hwEuMQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place with a heavy, satisfying resonance.\n\nI am closed. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown. My grain runs deep — old oak, iron-banded, scarred by knuckles and weather and years of hands reaching for what lies beyond.\n\nYou feel the cold of my handle even before you touch it.\n\nThe lock is set. The bolt is thrown. I hold fast.\n\nWhat stands before me stands *outside.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":112,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}